ng to a 2008 study published in the Journal of Aerospace Engineering, \\\"International Students at Moscow Aviation Institute: A Case Study,\\\" Sun was one of the top-performing international students in his cohort, with a GPA of 4.8\\\\/5.0.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"[1]\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"During his time at MAI, Sun was involved in several research projects, including a collaborative study with the Russian Academy of Sciences on advanced materials for aerospace applications.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"This research was later published in the journal Aerospace Materials and Technology in 2010.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"Notable Research Contributions\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"After completing his studies at MAI, Sun went on to make significant contributions to the field of aerospace engineering.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"His research on advanced propulsion systems has been widely cited and has led to the development of more efficient and sustainable propulsion technologies.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"References\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"[1] Kuznetsov, V.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"et al.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"(2008).\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"International Students at Moscow Aviation Institute: A Case Study.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"Journal of Aerospace Engineering, 21(3), 231-238.\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"[2] Sun, Y.\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"et al.\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"(2010).\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"Advanced Materials for Aerospace Applications: A Collaborative Study.\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"Aerospace Materials and Technology, 10(2), 123-135.\"}, {\"id\": \"s26\", \"text\": \"[3] Moscow Aviation Institute.\"}, {\"id\": \"s27\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s28\", \"text\": \"International Cooperation.\"}, {\"id\": \"s29\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/ww